  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiji Carbon Budget and Fossil Fuel Subsidy Policy Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2022, GGGI completed the Fossil Fuel Subsidy Reform Study, which provided recommendations on replacing fossil fuel subsidies with better fiscal incentives. This project will build on this work in 2023-24 by designing a subsidy reform roadmap and providing support to Fiji government to initiate implementation of the roadmap.</narrative>
  </description>
